# Credential files, should any ever be written to disk. Google service-account
# details are reconstructed from .env at runtime (see data_manager.py), so no key
# file is expected here - this is belt and braces. Replaces a blanket *.json,
# which also silently ignored legitimate config such as launch.json.
*service-account*.json
*credentials*.json
client_secret*.json

